{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27980","headline":"送浙东周判官 · 朱庆余","name":"送浙东周判官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"久闻从事沧江外，谁谓无官已白头。\n来备戎装嘶数骑，去持丹诏入孤舟。\n蝉鸣远驿残阳树，鹭起湖田片雨秋。\n到日重陪丞相宴，镜湖新月在城楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱庆余","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27980.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27980","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}